    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372500/extras/cc092376f0675dc8c03885bc6aa1c28a.avif?t=1736540845\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You always leave so quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- But you have so much work\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- I get it. I totally understand. But what if\u2026 What if you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- What if you suddenly get a day off?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372500/extras/d384fc88c8c37d787d51338adf70dbf7.avif?t=1736540845\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The washed-out red line traces a confident path away from the labyrinth city, toward the lands of dreams strewn with golden petals. <br>Were that line to break, a story would start. A story of the boundless and the omnipotent, of the minuscule and the fragile.<br><br>From the creator of Milk inside/outside a bag of milk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372500/extras/cc092376f0675dc8c03885bc6aa1c28a.avif?t=1736540845\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You always leave so quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- But you have so much work\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- I get it. I totally understand. But what if\u2026 What if you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- What if you suddenly get a day off?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372500/extras/d384fc88c8c37d787d51338adf70dbf7.avif?t=1736540845\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The washed-out red line traces a confident path away from the labyrinth city, toward the lands of dreams strewn with golden petals. <br>Were that line to break, a story would start. A story of the boundless and the omnipotent, of the minuscule and the fragile.<br><br>From the creator of Milk inside/outside a bag of milk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
